    "detailed_description": "Get into action with Violet Bricks, an exciting puzzle game featuring Violet, a brave heroine who needs to defeat alien robots across dozens of challenging levels. Inspired by classics like Arkanoid, the game features modern 3D graphics and a variety of power-ups to collect. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped by Vektro Digital, this is a game that will test your skills and offer plenty of modernized nostalgic fun!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Original arts 3d and 2d! <br />\r\n- 10 different power ups!<br />\r\n- Some kinds of bricks and many colours!",
